	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Literę tuę ut desyderatissimę ita etiam iucundissimę fuerunt, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>mi venerande charissimeque <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, quibus ne vicissim <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>scribendo respondeam, facit, quod plusquam charissimus frater et symmysta <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>meus <persName ref="p4868">Funclius</persName> ad vos nunc proficiscitur, qui vice tibi fuerit <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>longissimarum literarum, hoc etiam illis gratior, quod viva voce et meliore <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>fide de rebus omnibus et communibus nostris et privatis meis, ut sese <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>habeant, exponere tibi omnia poterit.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quem tibi ut me ipsum, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>quandoquidem non alter ego, sed idem plane est, qui ego, commendo.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Adulescens, quem misisti, ad scholę ministerium a nostris receptus est; <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quod ut felix illi sit ac faustum, omnibus illi votis optamus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Cętera <persName ref="p4868">Funclius</persName>, qui omnia nostra probe tenet, cogitationum etiam <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>mearum conscius.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale, anime mi, nostri perpetuo <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>apud dominum memor, qui te ecclesię suę quam diutissime <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>servet florentem ac usque feliciter proficientem.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salveat <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>tota tua domus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de">Es stat und blypt ewig in alten rechten; <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>lasst mich allweg den euwern sin.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de">Ich hab schier einen <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>wagen voll brieff geschriben, hinuß und auch gen <placeName ref="l18">Augspurg</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/><persName ref="p3927">Welserus</persName> gruͤtzt euch uff das fruntlichst, zoͤgt an, der keiser <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>nemme sinen weg in <placeName ref="l875">Hispanien</placeName>, <persName ref="p20183">duca de Alb</persName> fuͤre die <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>sachen, zuͦ <placeName ref="l232">Inspruck</placeName> und anderschwa grosß volck angenomen.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Der <placeName ref="l2448">fünff Ort</placeName> ding seye narrenwerck, werden nichts <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ussrichten; <foreign xml:lang="la">accepit enim, quid illi conentur etc.</foreign></s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">5. novembris<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>T[uus] <persName ref="p8055">Amb[rosius] Bl[aurerus]</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praestantissimo viro d. <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">H. Bullingero</persName> suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
